}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T20:46:27Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T20:46:27Z","body":"> I have the editor from the artifacts but I don't understand how to get the template for this version, if I try to get windows-template from the artifacts it results in error and if I use the one for beta1 it won't recognize it as this version only says beta\n\nYou need to download the `android-template-arm64`, which contains an `android_source.zip`. When installing the Android build template, select `Install from file.`\n\nSince I haven't made any changes to the template itself, you can also use the beta1 version and simply update the text in `[Your Project]/android/.build_version` to \"4.4.dev\".","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613351850/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2613381727","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101985#issuecomment-2613381727","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101985","id":2613381727,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bxQpf","user":{"login":"keendra","id":8382952,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzODI5NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/838295